    <Fragment slot='caption'>
      Three files, three layers, each owning exactly one slice of the frame. The root layout renders
      the app header and sidebar and drops <code>{'{'}children{'}'}</code> in the middle; the section
      layout renders the program header and tabs and drops <code>{'{'}children{'}'}</code> below them;
      the page renders only its content. Nesting composes them into the screen the user sees, and a navigation
      re-renders only the innermost box that changed.
